<title>USA: TABLE - Ha-Lo Industries Inc Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Ha-Lo Industries Inc Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.12		    $0.08</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.12		     0.08</p>
<p> Net			  2,528		    1,589</p>
<p> Revs			90,854		   78,489</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	21,123		   20,665</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	21,243		   20,750</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 997 net includes a pre-tax, non-recurring charge of $598,000 or $0.02 a share related to the recently completed acquisition of Bradley Marketing Group.  </p>
<p>SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.15		    $0.11</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.15		     0.11</p>
<p> Net			  3,098		    2,206</p>
<p> Revs		     171,224		  146,337</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	21,085		   20,665</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	21,195		   20,750</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the six months ended June 30, 1997 include pre-tax, non-recurring charges of $2.654 million or $0.08 a share related to the acquisitions of Creative Concepts in Advertising, Entertel and Bradley Marketing Group.</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the six months ended June 30, 1996 were restated to reflect the above acquisitions, which were accounted for as poolings of interest.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
